<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ GZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.00	MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.85     PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) 5	   EOS	   04.APR.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
